{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/14","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/14/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/14/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/14/events","html_url":"https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/14","id":6137823984,"node_id":"I_kwDOVESuUM8AAAABbdfC8A","number":14,"title":"make test fails on Linux/x86-64: native volume service faults, storage falls back to tmpfs","user":{"login":"CG-8663","id":230511811,"node_id":"U_kgDODb1Uww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230511811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663","html_url":"https://github.com/CG-8663","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CG-8663/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-31T17:37:20Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:53:21Z","closed_at":"2026-11-02T01:53:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\nOn main 22d20a6, `tests/qemu/boot.sh` fails with \"initial boot did not prove native volume IOMMU lifecycle isolation\". The compiled native volume service takes a #GP in ring 3 (rip 0x8000005146, same address on every run and with both builds below), its request never completes (`native volume event/completion/status/roots/frames: 268435716 0 0 0 0 116734 0 0`), the retry faults the same way, and the kernel continues with \"persistent volume unavailable; continuing with tmpfs-only storage\". On some runs it instead stops at \"replacement native volume service invariant failed\".\n\nWhat I varied, all with the same result:\n\n| Variable | Tried |\n|---|---|\n| QEMU | 10.0.13, 10.1.2 (built from the release tarball, sha256 9d75f331...), 11.1.2 |\n| Accelerator | KVM and TCG |\n| Embedded binaries | rebuilt here, and your committed generated_boot.rs (`make -o manifest`) |\n| vCPUs | 2 (default) and 1 |\n\nNot varied: firmware is Debian OVMF 2025.02-8+deb13u1, and the host is Linux rather than macOS.\n\nDoes `make test` pass for you on main with your current setup? If you can tell me your OVMF build, I'll try it here. Full serial logs are available.\n","closed_by":{"login":"gmkurtzer","id":13984965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg0OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13984965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer","html_url":"https://github.com/gmkurtzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com